-- A conjunction of MAYBE BOOLEAN answers that keeps "not covered": any JUST FALSE makes it JUST FALSE, otherwise any
-- NOTHING makes it NOTHING.
-- src:1287 | 102 Re-registration of private limited company as unlimited
-- src:1288 | (1) A private limited company may be re-registered as an unlimited company if—
-- src:1289 | (a) all the members of the company have assented to its being so re-registered,
-- src:1290 | (b) the condition specified below is met, and
-- src:1291 | (c) an application for re-registration is delivered to the registrar in accordance with section 103, together with—
-- src:1292 | (i) the other documents required by that section, and
-- src:1293 | (ii) a statement of compliance.
@ref s 102(1) Re-registration of private limited company as unlimited (the conditions together) (src:1287-1293)
GIVEN answers IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(1) all of the answers hold` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN answer YIELD answer EQUALS JUST FALSE) answers
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A private limited company may be re-registered as an unlimited company if— (a) ..., (b) ..., and (c) ..."
    ELSE IF any (GIVEN answer YIELD answer EQUALS NOTHING) answers
         THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): an answer another section gives is not known
         ELSE JUST TRUE

DECLARE `s 102(4) member` HAS
    `the member has assented` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a trustee in bankruptcy of the member is entitled to assent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the trustee in bankruptcy has assented` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the member is deceased` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the personal representative of the deceased member has assented on behalf of the deceased` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:1301 | (5) In subsection (4)(a), “a trustee in bankruptcy of a member of the company” includes—
-- src:1302 | (a) a trustee or interim trustee in the sequestration under the Bankruptcy (Scotland) Act 2016 of the estate of a member of the company;
-- src:1303 | (b) a trustee under a protected trustee deed (within the meaning of the Bankruptcy (Scotland) Act 2016) granted by a member of the company.
@ref s 102(5) "a trustee in bankruptcy of a member" includes (src:1301-1303)
GIVEN `the person is a trustee in bankruptcy of the member` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a trustee or interim trustee in the sequestration under the Bankruptcy (Scotland) Act 2016 of the estate of a member of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a trustee under a protected trust deed (within the meaning of the Bankruptcy (Scotland) Act 2016) granted by a member of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(5) the person is a trustee in bankruptcy of a member of the company` MEANS
    IF       `the person is a trustee in bankruptcy of the member`
         OR  `the person is a trustee or interim trustee in the sequestration under the Bankruptcy (Scotland) Act 2016 of the estate of a member of the company`
         OR  `the person is a trustee under a protected trust deed (within the meaning of the Bankruptcy (Scotland) Act 2016) granted by a member of the company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "“a trustee in bankruptcy of a member of the company” includes—"

-- src:1298 | (4) For the purposes of this section—
-- src:1299 | (a) a trustee in bankruptcy of a member of the company is entitled, to the exclusion of the member, to assent to the company's becoming unlimited; and
-- src:1300 | (b) the personal representative of a deceased member of the company may assent on behalf of the deceased.
@ref s 102(4) Who may assent for a member (src:1298-1300)
GIVEN member IS A `s 102(4) member`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(4) the member's assent is given` MEANS
    IF member's `a trustee in bankruptcy of the member is entitled to assent`
    THEN IF member's `the trustee in bankruptcy has assented`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "a trustee in bankruptcy of a member of the company is entitled, to the exclusion of the member, to assent to the company's becoming unlimited"
    ELSE IF member's `the member is deceased`
         THEN IF member's `the personal representative of the deceased member has assented on behalf of the deceased`
              THEN JUST TRUE
              ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(a) all the members of the company have assented to its being so re-registered" (the deceased member's personal representative has not assented on his behalf)
         ELSE IF member's `the member has assented`
              THEN JUST TRUE
              ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(a) all the members of the company have assented to its being so re-registered"

-- src:1288 | (1) A private limited company may be re-registered as an unlimited company if—
-- src:1289 | (a) all the members of the company have assented to its being so re-registered,
@ref s 102(1)(a) All the members of the company have assented (src:1288-1289)
GIVEN members IS A LIST OF `s 102(4) member`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(1)(a) all the members of the company have assented` MEANS
    `s 102(1) all of the answers hold` (map (GIVEN member YIELD `s 102(4) the member's assent is given` member) members)

-- src:1294 | (2) The condition is that the company has not previously been re-registered as limited.
@ref s 102(2) The condition (src:1294-1294)
GIVEN `the company has previously been re-registered as limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(2) the condition is met` MEANS
    IF `the company has previously been re-registered as limited`
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The condition is that the company has not previously been re-registered as limited."
    ELSE JUST TRUE

-- src:1287 | 102 Re-registration of private limited company as unlimited
-- src:1288 | (1) A private limited company may be re-registered as an unlimited company if—
-- src:1289 | (a) all the members of the company have assented to its being so re-registered,
-- src:1290 | (b) the condition specified below is met, and
-- src:1291 | (c) an application for re-registration is delivered to the registrar in accordance with section 103, together with—
-- src:1292 | (i) the other documents required by that section, and
-- src:1293 | (ii) a statement of compliance.
@ref s 102(1) Re-registration of private limited company as unlimited (src:1287-1293)
GIVEN `s 4(1) the company is a private company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 3(1) the company is a limited company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 102(1)(a) all the members of the company have assented` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 102(2) the condition is met` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `an application for re-registration is delivered to the registrar in accordance with section 103, together with the other documents required by that section` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a statement of compliance is delivered together with the application` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(1) the private limited company may be re-registered as an unlimited company` MEANS
    IF NOT (`s 4(1) the company is a private company` AND `s 3(1) the company is a limited company`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A private limited company may be re-registered"
    ELSE
        `s 102(1) all of the answers hold`
            (LIST   `s 102(1)(a) all the members of the company have assented`
                  , `s 102(2) the condition is met`
                  , (IF `an application for re-registration is delivered to the registrar in accordance with section 103, together with the other documents required by that section` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)
                  , (IF `a statement of compliance is delivered together with the application` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE))

