`s 102(3)(a) the company must make such changes in its name and its articles as are necessary in connection with its becoming an unlimited company` MEANS
    IF `the company is being re-registered as an unlimited company under section 102`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection speaks of the company's becoming an unlimited company on this re-registration

-- src:1295 | (3) The company must make such changes in its name and its articles—
