GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 103(4) the statement of compliance contains the directors' statement` MEANS
    IF       `the statement of compliance contains a statement by the directors that the persons by whom or on whose behalf the form of assent is authenticated constitute the whole membership of the company`
         AND ((NOT (`some of the members have not authenticated the form themselves`)) OR `the statement of compliance contains a statement by the directors that they have taken all reasonable steps to satisfy themselves that each person who authenticated it on behalf of a member was lawfully empowered to do so`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The statement must contain a statement by the directors of the company— (a) ... (b) if any of the members have not authenticated that form themselves, ..."

