-- src:1396 | 110 Application and accompanying documents
-- src:1397 | (1) An application for re-registration of a public company as an unlimited private company must contain a statement of the company's proposed name on re-registration.
@ref s 110(1) The application must contain a statement of the proposed name (src:1396-1397)
GIVEN `the application contains a statement of the company's proposed name on re-registration` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 110(1) the application contains what the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF `the application contains a statement of the company's proposed name on re-registration`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "An application for re-registration of a public company as an unlimited private company must contain a statement of the company's proposed name on re-registration."

-- src:1396 | 110 Application and accompanying documents
-- src:1398 | (2) The application must be accompanied by—
-- src:1399 | (a) the prescribed form of assent to the company's being registered as an unlimited company, authenticated by or on behalf of all the members of the company, and
-- src:1400 | (b) a copy of the company's articles as proposed to be amended.
@ref s 110(2) The application must be accompanied by (src:1396-1400)
GIVEN `the prescribed form of assent accompanies the application` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 1146 the form of assent is authenticated by or on behalf of all the members of the company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `a copy of the company's articles as proposed to be amended accompanies the application` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 110(2) the application is accompanied by what the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`the prescribed form of assent accompanies the application`)) OR (NOT (`a copy of the company's articles as proposed to be amended accompanies the application`))
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The application must be accompanied by— (a) the prescribed form of assent ... and (b) a copy of the company's articles as proposed to be amended"
    ELSE CONSIDER `s 1146 the form of assent is authenticated by or on behalf of all the members of the company`
         WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "authenticated by or on behalf of all the members of the company"
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the form is authenticated is s 1146's answer and it is not known

-- src:1401 | (3) The statement of compliance required to be delivered together with the application is a statement that the requirements of this Part as to re-registration as an unlimited private company have been complied with.
@ref s 110(3) The statement of compliance (src:1401-1401)
GIVEN `the statement is that the requirements of this Part as to re-registration as an unlimited private company have been complied with` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 110(3) the statement meets the description of the statement of compliance` MEANS
    IF `the statement is that the requirements of this Part as to re-registration as an unlimited private company have been complied with`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The statement of compliance ... is a statement that the requirements of this Part as to re-registration as an unlimited private company have been complied with."

-- src:1402 | (4) The statement must contain a statement by the directors of the company—
-- src:1403 | (a) that the persons by whom or on whose behalf the form of assent is authenticated constitute the whole membership of the company, and
-- src:1404 | (b) if any of the members have not authenticated that form themselves, that the directors have taken all reasonable steps to satisfy themselves that each person who authenticated it on behalf of a member was lawfully empowered to do so.
@ref s 110(4) The directors' statement (src:1402-1404)
GIVEN `the statement of compliance contains a statement by the directors that the persons by whom or on whose behalf the form of assent is authenticated constitute the whole membership of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `some of the members have not authenticated the form themselves` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement of compliance contains a statement by the directors that they have taken all reasonable steps to satisfy themselves that each person who authenticated it on behalf of a member was lawfully empowered to do so` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 110(4) the statement of compliance contains the directors' statement` MEANS
    IF       `the statement of compliance contains a statement by the directors that the persons by whom or on whose behalf the form of assent is authenticated constitute the whole membership of the company`
         AND ((NOT (`some of the members have not authenticated the form themselves`)) OR `the statement of compliance contains a statement by the directors that they have taken all reasonable steps to satisfy themselves that each person who authenticated it on behalf of a member was lawfully empowered to do so`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The statement must contain a statement by the directors of the company— (a) ... (b) if any of the members have not authenticated that form themselves, ..."

-- src:1405 | (5) The registrar may accept the statement of compliance as sufficient evidence that the company is entitled to be re-registered as an unlimited private company.
